{"t": 1793283349283, "cmd": "note", "args": ["--shot", "debris_up", "After sawing the fallen rafter through (tick ~4290), the checklist 'Haul out the debris' count went UP from 15 left to 17 left: the rafter (counted as 1) became 3 pieces. Progress counter going backwards after finishing a task feels like a setback; no message explains it."]}
{"t": 1793283356766, "cmd": "note", "args": ["CORRECTION to debris_up: the game did show a status line at tick 4217 ('Sawn into three lengths... three pieces to haul out instead of one'), so the 15->17 rise is explained, though the message is brief and easy to miss at low fps. Sawing took ~11 s of hold (ticks ~3770-4217 incl. a release); progress held at 6%->12% across a release, it does not reset."]}
